# 必考词 Unit 16 短语

## 常考短语

- **give a lecture**: 做讲座 — The professor gave a lecture on economics. 教授做了一场经济学讲座。
- **take legal action**: 采取法律行动 — The company took legal action against the competitor. 公司对竞争对手采取了法律行动。
- **at leisure**: 闲暇时 — You can read the book at leisure. 你可以在闲暇时读这本书。
- **liberal arts**: 文科 — She studied liberal arts at university. 她在大学学的是文科。
- **a means of**: …的一种手段 — Education is a means of improving one's life. 教育是改善生活的一种手段。
- **by all means**: 务必；当然可以 — By all means, come and join us. 务必来加入我们。
- **by no means**: 绝不 — This is by no means an easy task. 这绝不是一项容易的任务。
- **within the limits of**: 在…范围内 — Work within the limits of your budget. 在预算范围内工作。
- **link...to/with**: 把…与…联系起来 — Scientists linked the disease to a genetic mutation. 科学家将这种疾病与基因突变联系起来。
- **be located in/at**: 位于 — The school is located in the suburbs. 学校位于郊区。
- **maintain order**: 维持秩序 — The police maintained order during the protest. 警察在抗议期间维持了秩序。
- **manage to do sth**: 设法做到 — She managed to finish the project on time. 她设法按时完成了项目。
- **in a...manner**: 以…方式 — He handled the situation in a professional manner. 他以专业的方式处理了情况。
- **at the maximum**: 最多 — The room can hold 50 people at the maximum. 这个房间最多能容纳50人。
- **the mechanism of**: …的机制 — Scientists are studying the mechanism of memory. 科学家正在研究记忆的机制。
